.SH "نام (NAME)"
dracut-catimages \- creates initial ramdisk image by concatenating images
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBdracut\-catimages\fP [\fIOPTION\fP.\|.\|.] \fI<initramfs base image>\fP [\fI<image>\fP.\|.\|.]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
dracut\-catimages creates an initial ramdisk image by concatenating several
images from the command line and /var/lib/dracut/images/*.img
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-f, \-\-force\fP
.RS 4
overwrite existing initramfs file.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-i, \-\-imagedir\fP
.RS 4
Directory with additional images to add (default: /var/lib/dracut/images/)
.RE
.sp
\fB\-o, \-\-overlaydir\fP
.RS 4
Overlay directory, which contains additional files that will be used to
create an additional image
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-nooverlay\fP
.RS 4
Do not use the overlay directory
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-noimagedir\fP
.RS 4
Do not use the additional image directory
.RE
.sp
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fP
.RS 4
display help text and exit.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-debug\fP
.RS 4
output debug information of the build process
.RE
.sp
\fB\-v, \-\-verbose\fP
.RS 4
verbose output during the build process
.RE
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
.sp
\fI/var/lib/dracut/images/*.img\fP
.RS 4
images to work with
.RE
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.sp
Harald Hoyer
.SH "AVAILABILITY"
.sp
The dracut\-catimages command is part of the dracut package and is available from
